<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2b1559-zh-4a37d5d0" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>嵇康·声无哀乐论 </title><editor role="translator">Ji Liankang 吉聊抗TLS Project</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>嵇康·声无哀乐论 </title>北京：人民音樂出版社，1980</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2b1559"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-05-06T23:39:31.041+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2b1559-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:42:21.007+09:00">有一位"秦客"①問"東野主人"②道：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:42:38.151+09:00">照傳統的說法是:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:42:42.878+09:00">"治世"的音樂安詳而且歡樂，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:42:47.762+09:00">“亡國"的音樂悲哀而且憂慮③。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:42:53.991+09:00">大凡國家的治和亂在于政事，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:43:00.729+09:00">而聲音應和着它，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:43:32.216+09:00">所以悲哀和思慮的感情</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:43:36.723+09:00">表露于金石④，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:44:09.236+09:00">安詳和歡樂的形象</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:44:17.774+09:00">出現于管弦呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:44:29.667+09:00">又像仲尼聽到韶樂，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:45:13.456+09:00">體察到虞舜的德行⑤；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:45:24.877+09:00">季札聽到弦歌，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:45:29.796+09:00">識別出各國的謠曲⑥。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:46:04.796+09:00">這些以前的事實</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:46:09.09+09:00">,是過去的人們所不曾懷疑過的呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:46:17.431+09:00">现在您却獨自以爲音樂本身沒有哀樂。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:46:27.874+09:00">它的理由在什麽地方？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:46:40.991+09:00">倘使有高論，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:47:16.299+09:00">請您說給我聽！</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:47:25.213+09:00">"主人"答覆他道：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:47:47.498+09:00">這個道理久已深入人心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:48:11.084+09:00">很難挽回⑦，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:48:29.236+09:00">所以使得很多世代</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:48:39.801+09:00">都鬧不淸名和實的關係；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:49:04.896+09:00">現在承蒙您啓導⑤，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:50:11.058+09:00">我就講講這個道理的一些方面吧(9）。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:50:24.027+09:00">大凡天地之氣融合，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:50:30.015+09:00">萬物才能滋生⑩：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:50:35.757+09:00">四時運行交替，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:50:44.86+09:00">五行因而形成，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:50:56.701+09:00">表現爲五色，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:51:08.648+09:00">發出爲五音⑪。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:51:18.51+09:00">聲音的作用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:51:52.287+09:00">就像氣⑫味存在于天地之間。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:51:58.407+09:00">它的好或者不好，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.39" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:52:05.785+09:00">雖然遭遇着世事的變亂，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:52:18.478+09:00">本體還是保持原樣而不變的呀--</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:52:31.399+09:00">難道會因爲愛好和憎惡而變易曲調⑬、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:54:14.234+09:00">近哀和歡樂</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:54:21.325+09:00">而改動律度⑭嗎？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:54:37.884+09:00">至於宮音商音等够排比起來，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:54:58.709+09:00">聲音十分諧和，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.46" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:55:06.006+09:00">這是人們最高的願望，鐘和鼓這些樂器嗎? "</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.47" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:55:10.429+09:00">也是情欲集中的結晶。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:55:21.566+09:00">古人知道感情不能放縱，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:55:33.622+09:00">欲望不能過度，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.50" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:55:43.109+09:00">所以順應着它所需要的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.51" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:55:48.204+09:00">時常加以節制，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.52" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:55:58.531+09:00">使它悲哀而不至傷害身心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.53" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:56:24.589+09:00">歡樂而不至漫無限度；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:56:38.835+09:00">對于不同的事給予不同的名稱，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.55" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:57:01.724+09:00">每樣東西都有自己的稱號：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.56" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:57:08.123+09:00">哭泣叫做"哀"，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.57" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:57:13.155+09:00">歌唱叫做"樂"，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.58" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:57:35.534+09:00">這是它們大致的區別呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:57:51.96+09:00">然而"樂呀，樂呀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.60" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:59:52.47+09:00">難道是說鐘和鼓這些樂器嗎? "</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.61" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T23:59:59.815+09:00">哀呀，哀呀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.62" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:00:14.434+09:00">難道是說哭泣這種現象嗎?⑯</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.63" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:00:21.757+09:00">照這樣說來，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.64" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:00:30.438+09:00">玉帛之類的禮品不是禮儀的實質，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.65" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:00:46.892+09:00">唱歌和哭泣的現象不是哀樂的主體呀⑰。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.66" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:00:53.387+09:00">怎麽說呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.67" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:01:13.783+09:00">要知不同的地方有不同的風俗，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.68" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:01:33.667+09:00">歌唱和哭泣的意思也不同，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.69" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:01:46.362+09:00">假使用錯了地方，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.70" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:01:58.7+09:00">可能聽到哭泣而歡樂，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.71" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:02:17.087+09:00">或者聽到歌唱而悲戚,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.72" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:02:29.501+09:00">然而人們有哀樂的感情却是一樣的呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.73" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:09:13.084+09:00">現在由于同樣的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.74" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:09:20.353+09:00">而表現出各種不同的聲音,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.75" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:10:09.054+09:00">這豈不是聲音的表現沒有一定嗎？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.76" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:10:24.655+09:00">然而聲音諧和地組織起來，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.77" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:10:38.273+09:00">是感動人最深入的呀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.78" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:10:46.915+09:00">勞苦的人歌唱他的事蹟，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.79" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:11:53.14+09:00">歡樂的人歌舞他的功業。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.80" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:12:21.645+09:00">大凡內心有着悲痛的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.81" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:12:32.523+09:00">就會激發出哀切的語言，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.82" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:12:39.773+09:00">語言組織成詩篇，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.83" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:12:53.065+09:00">聲音組織成音樂。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.84" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:13:02.648+09:00">人們反覆地咏唱它，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.85" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:13:11.559+09:00">聚攏來傾聽它，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.86" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:13:29.815+09:00">內心爲諧和的音樂所激動，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.87" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:14:29.945+09:00">情緖爲淒慘的歌詞所感染，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.88" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:14:45.402+09:00">讚嘆聲沒有停，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.89" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:15:04.121+09:00">而眼淚鼻涕已經流漣縱橫啦。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.90" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:15:13.753+09:00">大凡悲哀的感情深藏于內心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.91" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:15:24.341+09:00">接觸到相應的聲音而後表露出來，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.92" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:15:28.871+09:00">相應的聲音不可捉摸，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.93" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:18:06.621+09:00">而悲哀的感情却是已有的存在；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.94" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:18:26.331+09:00">這種先已存在的悲哀的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.95" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:19:23.046+09:00">由于接觸到不可捉摸的相應的聲音而後表露出來⑬，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.96" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:19:34.612+09:00">那麽，他所感覺到的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.97" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:19:42.366+09:00">只是悲哀而已，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.98" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:20:57.23+09:00">哪裏還能知道"各種美妙的聲音</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.99" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:21:24.731+09:00">都出于自然"⑲呢?</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.100" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:22:09.226+09:00">風俗⑳的流變,</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.101" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:22:33.219+09:00">反映着政敎的得失，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.102" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:22:39.19+09:00">所以國家的史官辨別政敎的得失，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.103" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:22:44.92+09:00">審察謠曲所反映的盛衰，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.104" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:22:54.614+09:00">吟咏出人們的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.105" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:23:06.236+09:00">用以諷喩他的國君㉑，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.106" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:23:12.36+09:00">所以說</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.107" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:25:18.589+09:00">"亡國的音樂悲哀而且憂慮"呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.108" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:46:53.208+09:00">大凡喜、怒、哀、樂、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.109" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:46:57.058+09:00">愛、憎、惭、懼，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.110" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:47:03.934+09:00">這八種情緖，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.111" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:47:11.071+09:00">是人們用以接觸事物傳達感情、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.112" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:47:14.761+09:00">區別對待各種屬類、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.113" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:47:21.606+09:00">而不可能逸出範圍的呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.114" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:47:47.142+09:00">大凡滋味可以區分爲甘和苦這樣明顯的兩類--</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.115" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:47:52.908+09:00">現在因爲某甲賢明而發生喜愛的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.116" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:48:25.323+09:00">因爲某乙愚蠢而發生憎惡的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.117" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:48:50.888+09:00">那麽爱和憎的感情應該屬于我，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.118" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:48:58.455+09:00">而賢和愚的性質應該屬于他呀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.119" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:49:13.068+09:00">難道可以因爲我愛他而稱他爲可愛的人，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.120" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:49:24.996+09:00">我憎他就稱他爲可憎的人，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.121" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:49:34.903+09:00">對所喜歡的滋味就稱之爲可喜的滋味，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.122" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:49:42.537+09:00">對所討厭的滋味就稱之爲可厭的滋味嗎？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.123" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:49:48.003+09:00">由此看來，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.124" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:49:56.415+09:00">那麽外界和內心起不同的作用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.125" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:50:01.714+09:00">客觀和主觀有不同的名稱。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.126" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:50:08.888+09:00">聲音自然應當以好壞爲第，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.127" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:50:13.927+09:00">那麽無關于哀樂；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.128" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:50:18.507+09:00">哀樂自然應當因爲情有所感而後表露出來，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.129" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:50:40.563+09:00">那麽無關于聲音:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.130" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T00:50:45.011+09:00">名和實一起去掉，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.131" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T03:08:22.989+09:00">那就完全可以看淸楚了。 [??? Compare Cai Zhongde: 音乐之中既不存在感情之实.也不应有哀乐之名，这样，"声无哀乐"的道理就昭然若揭了。 CH]</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.132" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:02:44.292+09:00">而且季札在魯國，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.133" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:02:48.395+09:00">根據詩篇觀察政敎得失，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.134" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:03:01.503+09:00">用以區別風、雅等體裁㉒，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.135" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:03:06.87+09:00">豈是單單聽着聲音來加以評論的呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.136" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:03:30.76+09:00">又像仲尼 聽到韶樂，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.137" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:03:41.104+09:00">欣賞它的完整一致㉓，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.138" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:03:46.3+09:00">因而贊嘆，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.139" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:03:59.734+09:00">哪裏一定是從聲音裏知道了虞舜的徳行，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.140" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:04:13.108+09:00">然後讃美的呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.141" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:04:22.666+09:00">現在只是粗略地說明這麽一些方面，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.142" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-07T01:04:24.265+09:00">也可以知道它的大槪了吧！</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:26:45.086+09:00">"秦客"詰難道:</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:30:46.217+09:00">各地①風俗不同，【1原文"八方"，具禮指東、南、西、北、束南、西南、東北、西北八個方向，以此槪指各個不同的地方。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:30:52.981+09:00">歌唱和哭泣的表現形態多種多樣;</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:31:01.747+09:00">然而人們哀樂的感情，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:31:26.774+09:00">不能不有所表現②呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:31:36.554+09:00">大凡感情激動于內心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:31:43.271+09:00">而發出相應的聲音；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:32:55.69+09:00">雖然寄托於各種餘響</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T22:23:15.318+09:00">不絕的聲音③，【3原文是用對比句表逹一個意思，故譯爲一句。"他"、"我"的對稱詞，文意是說思想感情是"我”,是主觀的東西，是內在的；聲音是"他"，是客觀的東西，是外在的。因爲這個意思比較极雜，譯文中就從略了。"餘"，也有多餘的意思。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:34:59.481+09:00">具有高度聽察能力的人，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:35:14.671+09:00">總會自然地覺察出來，不至於發生誤解的呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T21:35:40.163+09:00">從前伯牙彈琴，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T22:23:44.308+09:00">而生子期知道他心里所到達的境界④；【4呂氏春秋本味： 伯牙鼓琴，鍾子期聽之。方鼓琴而志在太山，鍾子期曰 8善哉乎鼓琴，巍魏乎若太山。少選之間，而志在流水，錘子期又日,善哉乎鼓琴，湯湯乎若流水。“ (參看呂氏春秋音樂文字譯注一上海文藝出版社版。)】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T22:24:35.597+09:00">做奴隸的人在擊磬，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T22:24:42.9+09:00">而王產知道他心裏悲哀⑤；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T22:24:52.473+09:00">聾國有人在早晨哭泣，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-19T22:24:57.388+09:00">而隻渊知道他有着生離的痛苦⑥。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T01:18:07.773+09:00">象這幾個人這樣，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T01:18:55.072+09:00">難道還要從一定的聲音中得到啓發，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T01:19:04.307+09:00">借助于曲調的表現來驗證嗎？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T01:19:13.014+09:00">心里憂戚的人形色跟着變動，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T01:19:22.844+09:00">情緖悲痛的人聲音顯得哀愁，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T01:19:39.454+09:00">這是自然相應，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T01:19:44.323+09:00">不可能隱蔽的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:49:42.214+09:00">只是要具備高度辨別能力的人才能精通它罷了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:49:56.503+09:00">大凡擅長音樂的人並不因爲聲音複雜而感到難於認識，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:50:17.452+09:00">不懂音樂的人並不因爲聲音簡單而覺得易於了解。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:50:42.679+09:00">這就不可以因爲沒有遇着善聽音樂的人</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:51:09.605+09:00">而說聲音沒有可以察知的道理，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:51:22.16+09:00">看到各地風俗的種種變化</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:52:15.025+09:00">而說聲音沒有一定的哀樂呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:52:34.418+09:00">你又說</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:52:44.477+09:00">對於賢明的人不宜說是可爱的人，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:52:55.359+09:00">對於愚蠢的人不宜說是可憎的人。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:53:02.612+09:00">然而事實上有了"賢"然後有"可愛"的感覺產生，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:53:20.679+09:00">有了"愚”然後有"可憎"的感覺出現，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:53:26.142+09:00">只是不應當使它們共用一個名稱罢了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.39" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:53:40.831+09:00">哀樂這種感情的變化，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:53:46.786+09:00">也是這樣有着緣由才產生的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:53:51.724+09:00">這是聲音使我哀，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:53:56.727+09:00">聲音使我樂呀。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:54:12.629+09:00">倘使哀樂由于聲音的作用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:54:34.284+09:00">顯然這種作用有實在的意義，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-20T05:54:39.198+09:00">怎麽能把名和實一起去掉呢？</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>